-02-22 151939.png", "id": "3429613540539823", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_3429613547206489_1913068315039258094_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RP_JhBqeFmsQ7kNvwEiuqEU&_nc_oc=Adoxug75ucNkInq-pgEdvL-97Ai2GCxfPb-ywEW9mSg9MQ5JQf9w-w-xJfPqbPOZVqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ1mMjoVLEhAjpB9DNHWx1wBry2k6HJ7Xu2T1ahLFRtDQ&oe=6B0DD030"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ape Redux", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ape Redux takes cues from Lethal Ape and Starving Apes, building on their chaotic energy and tone.\nIt\u2019s a tribute to the absurd, intense worlds those games created.\n\nBig and grand environments with realistic audio force you into immersion, most objects are intractable. Giving you freedom in your experience.\n{1281249643344863}\n\nWild physics and bizarre AI behavior lead to moments that are as hilarious as they are horrifying.\nEven in the chaos, it\u2019s hard not to laugh.\n{2146649969144637}", "short_description": "Ape Redux is a two level VR game inspired by titles such as Lethal Ape, Lethal Ape Redux, and Starving Apes, delivering a horrifying yet absurdly funny experience."}]}, "developer_name": "MitchellGamz", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/aperedux", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MitchellGamz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/aperedux", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_pr